<p>We (GREP.AI, YC F26) are open-sourcing AgentRun and turning it into a full managed agents platform. Read more about it in this post: <a href="https://agentrun.ai/blog/introducing-agentrun-run-smarter-agents-use-fewer-tokens" rel="nofollow">https://agentrun.ai/blog/introducing-agentrun-run-smarter-ag...</a>.<p>It includes what we originally built for our own agent harness:<p>- Self-improving agents 
- Web-grounded workflows 
- A range of sandboxes and computer environments 
- Thousands of tools and integrations 
- Detailed analytics on how your agents behave<p>You can bring your own agent. AgentRun works with Pi, Claude Agents, Codex, OpenCode, and any other harness that supports ACP.<p>You can self-host it (see 1-click install on Render) with an OpenRouter key, or try the hosted version at console.agentrun.ai.<p>We’d love feedback, especially on the architecture (see README), or anything we may be missing to make it useful to you.</p>
